<div id="2026-11-18-git-update-all-preflight" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-18 — "Update all branches from main" checks each branch first and never stashes</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The Git page button (<code>Comserv::Util::Git::update_all_from_main</code>, <code>POST /admin/git/update_all_from_main</code>) now runs a preflight on every branch before git touches it, and merges only the branches that come out clean. Each row says <code>updated</code>, <code>up_to_date</code>, <code>skipped_dirty</code>, <code>skipped_untracked</code>, <code>skipped_conflict</code>, <code>skipped</code>, <code>missing</code> or <code>error</code>, with the files and a note per file: <em>same as main &ndash; safe to discard/delete</em> or <em>differs from main</em>.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Shanta, Nov 18: almost every branch needed manual fixing after each mass update. The old button retried any refused merge with <code>--autostash</code>; every collision left a file marked conflicted plus a stash entry (on Nov 18 <code>Controller/Api.pm</code> was stuck as unmerged in 10 worktrees and git held 41 autostash entries). It also walked only the 17 keys in <code>worktrees.json</code>, so 10 worktrees were never updated and fell 290&ndash;641 commits behind.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>How.</strong> Worktrees come from <code>git worktree list --porcelain</code> united with <code>worktrees.json</code> (both <code>&lt;base&gt;/&lt;key&gt;/Comserv</code> and <code>&lt;base&gt;/&lt;key&gt;</code> layouts; main, detached and prunable worktrees skipped; <code>update_all_skip</code> still the only opt-out). Per branch: files still marked conflicted or a merge in progress &rarr; <code>skipped_dirty</code>; <code>git merge-tree --write-tree HEAD main</code> reports conflicts &rarr; <code>skipped_conflict</code> (resolve by hand; rerere records it); uncommitted edits to files main changes &rarr; <code>skipped_dirty</code>; untracked files main would overwrite &rarr; <code>skipped_untracked</code>. Edits to files main does not change are left alone. Clean branches merge as before (<code>--ff-only</code>, or <code>--no-ff --no-edit</code> when the branch has its own commits); any failure runs <code>merge --abort</code>. <code>merge-tree</code> was added to the git whitelist (flags <code>--write-tree --name-only --no-messages</code>); its &ldquo;would conflict&rdquo; exit 1 logs at info, not as an error-audit todo.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>One-time cleanup (same day).</strong> The stale unmerged flag on <code>Controller/Api.pm</code> was cleared in 10 worktrees (content already equal to each branch's last commit). Backups in <code>~/comserv-cleanup-backup-20261118/</code>.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>lib/Comserv/Util/Git.pm</code>, <code>root/admin/git/index.tt</code>, <code>root/static/js/git-dashboard.js</code>, <code>t/git_update_all_from_main.t</code> (rewritten, 95 tests). Todo #2760.</p>
</div>
